msgstr ""

#: src/ai/llm-providers.md:168
msgid ""
"Zed enables extended context for supported models (Claude Sonnet 4.5, Claude "
"Opus 4.6, and Claude Opus 4.7). Extended context usage may increase API costs"
"—refer to AWS Bedrock pricing for details."
msgstr ""

