msgid ""
"Zed's plans offer hosted versions of major LLMs with higher rate limits than "
"direct API access. Model availability is updated regularly. To use your own "
"API keys instead, see [LLM Providers](./llm-providers.md). For general "
"setup, see [Configuration](./configuration.md)."
