"Zed of $20 ($10 for your Pro subscription, $10 in incremental token spend). "
"This can be set to $0 to limit your spend with Zed to exactly $10/month. If "
"you adjust this limit _higher_ than $10 and consume more than $10 of "
"incremental token spend, you'll be billed via [threshold billing](./billing."
"md#threshold-billing)."
