#: src/migrate/intellij.md:55
msgid "`relative_line_numbers`"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:55
msgid "Useful if you're coming from IdeaVim."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:57
msgid ""
"Zed also supports per-project settings. Create a `.zed/settings.json` file "
"in your project root to override global settings for that project, similar "
"to how you might use `.idea` folders in IntelliJ."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:59
msgid ""
"**Tip:** If you're joining an existing project, check `format_on_save` "
"before making your first commit. Otherwise you might accidentally reformat "
"an entire file when you only meant to change one line."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:61
msgid "Open or Create a Project"
msgstr "開啟或建立專案"

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:63
msgid ""
"After setup, press `Cmd+Shift+O` (with JetBrains keymap) to open a folder. "
"This becomes your workspace in Zed. Unlike IntelliJ, there's no project "
"configuration wizard, no `.iml` files, and no SDK setup required."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:65
msgid ""
"To start a new project, create a directory using your terminal or file "
"manager, then open it in Zed. The editor will treat that folder as the root "
"of your project."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:67
msgid ""
"You can also launch Zed from the terminal inside any folder with: `zed .`"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:70
msgid "Once inside a project:"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:72
msgid ""
"Use `Cmd+Shift+O` or `Cmd+E` to jump between files quickly (like IntelliJ's "
"\"Recent Files\")"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:73
msgid ""
"Use `Cmd+Shift+A` or `Shift Shift` to open the Command Palette (like "
"IntelliJ's \"Search Everywhere\")"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:74
msgid "Use `Cmd+O` to search for symbols (like IntelliJ's \"Go to Class\")"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:76
msgid ""
"Open buffers appear as tabs across the top. The Project Panel shows your "
"file tree and Git status. Toggle it with `Cmd+1` (just like IntelliJ's "
"Project tool window)."
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:78
msgid "Differences in Keybindings"
msgstr ""

#: src/migrate/intellij.md:80
msgid ""
"If you chose the JetBrains keymap during onboarding, most of your shortcuts "
