#: src/key-bindings.md:277
msgid ""
"The argument to `SendKeystrokes` is a space-separated list of keystrokes "
"(using the same syntax as above). Due to the way that keystrokes are parsed, "
"any segment that is not recognized as a keypress will be sent verbatim to "
