#: src/vim.md:246
msgid ""
"Vim mode allows you to open Zed's command palette with `:`. You can then "
"type to access any usual Zed command. Additionally, vim mode adds aliases "
"for popular Vim commands to ensure your muscle memory transfers to Zed. For "
"example, you can write `:w` or `:write` to save the file."
msgstr ""

