#: src/development/windows.md:185
msgid ""
"Sometimes, depending on the security rules applied to your laptop, you may "
"get the following error while compiling Zed:"
msgstr ""

#: src/development/windows.md:205
msgid ""
"To fix this issue, manually set the `ZED_RC_TOOLKIT_PATH` environment "
"variable to the RC toolkit path. Usually this is: `C:\\Program Files "
"(x86)\\Windows Kits\\10\\bin\\<SDK_version>\\x64`."
