#: src/languages/rust.md:185
msgid ""
"Which would mean that every time Zed saves, a `cargo check --workspace --all-"
"targets` command is run, checking the entire project (workspace), lib, doc, "
"test, bin, bench and [other targets](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/"
"reference/cargo-targets.html)."
