#: src/linux.md:375
msgid ""
"This changes the reported DPI for your entire X11 session, affecting how "
"RandR calculates scaling for all applications that use it."
msgstr ""

#: src/linux.md:377
msgid "Add this to your `.xprofile` or `.xinitrc`:"
msgstr ""

#: src/linux.md:383
msgid ""
"Replace `192` with your desired DPI value. This affects the system globally "
"and will be used by Zed's automatic RandR detection when `Xft.dpi` is not "
"set."
msgstr ""

