#: src/linux.md:393
msgid ""
"`ZED_FONTS_GRAYSCALE_ENHANCED_CONTRAST` corresponds to "
"[getgrayscaleenhancedcontrast](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/"
"win32/api/dwrite_1/nf-dwrite_1-idwriterenderingparams1-"
"getgrayscaleenhancedcontrast) values. Allowed range: \\[0.0, ..), other "
"values are clipped. Default: 1.0"
msgstr ""

