#: src/debugger.md:158
msgid ""
"All breakpoints enabled for a given project are also listed in "
"\"Breakpoints\" item in your debugging session UI. From \"Breakpoints\" item "
"in your UI you can also manage exception breakpoints. The debug adapter will "
"then stop whenever an exception of a given kind occurs. Which exception "
